1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,724
City inspection!
Open up!

2
00:00:02,764 --> 00:00:05,018
Welcome to Volt's Bakery!

3
00:00:06,088 --> 00:00:09,295
We got a report
of a mad scientist.

4
00:00:09,335 --> 00:00:12,869
Here? We just make bread.

5
00:00:14,739 --> 00:00:17,925
Why does it smell
like ozone?

6
00:00:17,965 --> 00:00:19,801
Sourdough.

7
00:00:23,903 --> 00:00:26,954
Clean. Quiet.
Five stars.

8
00:00:26,994 --> 00:00:30,032
Two dozen croissants.
Pickup at eight.

9
00:00:30,791 --> 00:00:33,920
Cleo.
Can we bake?

10
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,651
No. And you ate
the detonator.
